{"seq":1,"slug":"optimal-carton-selection-algorithm","title":"单件/多件最优箱选择算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-loading-optimization/cartonization-algorithm/optimal-carton-selection-algorithm","wordCount":2226,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"单件-多件最优箱选择算法\">单件/多件最优箱选择算法</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Cartonization（装箱选型）要回答的问题是：给定一个订单里的若干件商品和一份包材目录，选出总成本最低的箱组合方案，并给出每件商品在箱内的摆放。它在计算上落在三维装箱问题里——把不同尺寸的物品装进若干固定容积的箱，用尽可能少的箱（见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bin_packing_problem\">Bin packing problem</a> 对问题定义与 NP-hard 性质的说明）。</p>\n<p>问题的难处在三处叠加。第一，<strong>箱型是离散目录</strong>，不是无限可调尺寸，这排除了连续优化手段。第二，<strong>件数与朝向的自由度</strong>让搜索空间迅速爆炸：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 件商品各有若干可行朝向，还要决定分箱，方案数是超指数级的。第三，真正要最小化的不是&quot;箱数&quot;而是<strong>总成本</strong>：包材单价、体积重带来的运费、填充材料消耗、以及操作工时的加权和。同样的几何最优解，成本口径不同会推出不同方案。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[订单商品清单] --&gt; B[尺寸主数据]&#10;  B --&gt; C[候选箱型筛选]&#10;  C --&gt; D[单箱可行性判定]&#10;  D --&gt; E{全部装得下?}&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[成本评估]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G[贪心/搜索分箱]&#10;  G --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; H[约束校验: 承重/加固/朝向]&#10;  H --&gt; I[方案排序取最优]&#10;  I --&gt; J[输出装箱指令]\">graph TD\n  A[订单商品清单] --&gt; B[尺寸主数据]\n  B --&gt; C[候选箱型筛选]\n  C --&gt; D[单箱可行性判定]\n  D --&gt; E{全部装得下?}\n  E --&gt;|是| F[成本评估]\n  E --&gt;|否| G[贪心/搜索分箱]\n  G --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; H[约束校验: 承重/加固/朝向]\n  H --&gt; I[方案排序取最优]\n  I --&gt; J[输出装箱指令]</pre><h2 id=\"可行性判定\">可行性判定</h2><h3 id=\"单件装单箱\">单件装单箱</h3><p>最简单的情形是单件商品选箱。给定商品规范化尺寸 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(l_1,l_2,l_3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与箱内径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>W</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(L,W,H)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，可行条件不是&quot;逐分量小于等于&quot;这么简单——商品可以旋转。正确的判定是：存在一个置换 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>l</mi><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>L</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>W</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l_{\\pi(1)} \\le L, l_{\\pi(2)} \\le W, l_{\\pi(3)} \\le H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0496em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0496em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0496em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span>。由于两侧都已按非递增排序，这个判定退化为可直接比较的三元组不等式（这正得益于 <a href=\"item-dimension-weight-masterdata\">尺寸主数据</a> 的统一朝向约定）。</p>\n<p>但&quot;装得下&quot;不等于&quot;能发&quot;。还要叠加：内径需预留缓冲与内衬厚度、商品不许超出箱口、承重不超过 <code>max_load_g</code>、以及若商品标记&quot;向上&quot;则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 必须对齐到箱的高轴。</p>\n<h3 id=\"多件装单箱\">多件装单箱</h3><p>多件进同一箱时，判定从&quot;尺寸比较&quot;变成&quot;排布搜索&quot;。工程上不做完整三维布尔运算（太慢），而是用<strong>候选放置点 + 冲突检查</strong>的启发式。常见的做法是维护一组&quot;极端点&quot;（extreme points）：每个已放物品的角点在三个坐标方向上的投影交点构成候选位置，新物品尝试放到这些点上，需要与已放物品做轴对齐包围盒（AABB）的重叠检查。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def can_pack(items, box, eps):&#10;    # items 已按体积降序；eps 初始为 {(0,0,0)}&#10;    placed = []&#10;    for it in items:&#10;        for (x, y, z) in sorted(eps, key=lambda p: (p[2], p[1], p[0])):&#10;            for rot in feasible_rotations(it, box):&#10;                if fits(it, rot, x, y, z, box) and not overlaps_any(x, y, z, rot, placed):&#10;                    placed.append(Placement(it, x, y, z, rot))&#10;                    eps = update_extreme_points(eps, x, y, z, rot, box)&#10;                    break&#10;            else:&#10;                continue&#10;            break&#10;        else:&#10;            return None            # 该箱装不下全部&#10;    return placed\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> can_pack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(items, box, eps):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # items 已按体积降序；eps 初始为 {(0,0,0)}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    placed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> it </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> items:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (x, y, z) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sorted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(eps, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p: (p[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], p[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], p[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rot </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> feasible_rotations(it, box):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fits(it, rot, x, y, z, box) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> overlaps_any(x, y, z, rot, placed):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    placed.append(Placement(it, x, y, z, rot))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    eps </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> update_extreme_points(eps, x, y, z, rot, box)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                    break</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                continue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            break</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            # 该箱装不下全部</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> placed</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个结构的关键在 <code>update_extreme_points</code>：放好一件后，把新产生的角点并入候选集，并删除被支配的点（坐标逐分量都更大的点永远不会被优先使用，可以剪枝）。极端点方法把连续的放置空间离散成有限候选，让多件装单箱从不可解变成多项式时间的贪心。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分箱策略\">分箱策略</h2><h3 id=\"贪心与近似比\">贪心与近似比</h3><p>箱数最小化本身是 NP-hard 的，所以生产系统用的都是近似算法。一维情形下,按体积降序排列后依次放入第一个能装下的箱（First Fit Decreasing, FFD）有紧的保证：<code>FFD(I) = 11/9 OPT(I) + 6/9</code>（见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bin_packing_problem\">Bin packing problem</a>）。三维情形没有这么漂亮的界，但&quot;大件优先、后进先填缝&quot;的直觉仍然成立：大件决定分箱骨架，小件用来填剩余空间。</p>\n<p>三类解法的取舍可以直接对照。精确解法在订单规模稍大时就不可用；纯启发式足够快但质量有上限；学习式方法在特定分布上能超过启发式但需要训练数据与推理成本。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>解法</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n<th>时间特性</th>\n<th>适用规模</th>\n<th>主要限制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>精确求解</td>\n<td>分支定界 / 整数规划</td>\n<td>指数级最坏</td>\n<td>单箱、件数 ≤ 10</td>\n<td>无法在线调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>启发式</td>\n<td>极端点 + First Fit Decreasing</td>\n<td>多项式</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td>解质量有上限，需调参</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习式</td>\n<td>深度强化学习优化放置序列</td>\n<td>推理快、训练贵</td>\n<td>分布稳定的场景</td>\n<td>分布漂移后需重训</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把装箱的<strong>件序</strong>当作被优化的对象是学习式方法的切入点：把一组长方体逐件正交放入箱中、以最小化箱体表面积为目标，其解依赖件序、放置与朝向，其中件序被识别为最关键的因素，用指针网络一类的深度强化学习方法优化件序，其报告结果比纯启发式有约 5% 的改进（见 <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1708.05930\">Solving a New 3D Bin Packing Problem with Deep Reinforcement Learning Method</a>）。这个量级说明了现实：学习式方法不是数量级的跃升，它是在启发式已经把 90% 的空间吃掉之后争夺剩下的几个点。因此生产系统的合理结构通常是启发式打底、学习式在特定高价值分段上叠加，而不是全盘替换。</p>\n<h3 id=\"尺寸分档与箱型筛选\">尺寸分档与箱型筛选</h3><p>不必对全部箱型做搜索。先按订单的总体积与最长边做一次粗筛：总体积决定箱型体积下界，最长边决定箱型&quot;至少一个内径维度不小于它&quot;。粗筛后通常只剩几种候选箱，搜索成本立刻可控。这一步还能提前排除明显不划算的箱型——比如用大箱装小件会很贵，因为它的体积重会惩罚你。</p>\n<h3 id=\"订单聚合与合单\">订单聚合与合单</h3><p>跨订单的合单能显著提升装载率：同一个买家同一批次的多个订单合并成一次发运，往往能从两只箱变成一只箱加填充。但合单有代价——承诺时效可能被迫延后。所以合单决策是一个带时间窗的组合问题，通常与装箱分开处理，由订单编排先给出&quot;可合并组&quot;，再交给选箱算法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本目标函数\">成本目标函数</h2><h3 id=\"成本项的构成\">成本项的构成</h3><p>几何最优与成本最优常常不同。总成本可以写成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"